DESCRIPTION:For years now David Lucas has seen people in therapy not making
  any improvements in their lives. Perhaps therapists are being too soft on
  their patients... At roast therapy you can come to David with your proble
 ms but don't expect him to give you a polite answer\, sometimes the cold h
 ard truth is a tough pill to swallow.\n\nBIO: David Lucas started his care
 er early on the MTV “Yo Momma” show. Soon after being on the show\, he 
 moved to Hollywood to pursue his entertainment career. Landing a role on th
 e hit show “Roast Me” on All Def Digital he became a popular meme. When
  David became a regular on the Kill Tony Show he was acknowledged by legend
 ary comedians as a quick-witted joke writer and a vicious Roaster. He is so
 lidifying his name as one of the greatest comics of his generation. You can
  catch him headlining across the country and also opening for Louis CK\, Jo
 e Rogan\, and Tony Hinchcliffe. Also featured in the Roast of Mr. Peanut\, 
 the commercial snippet aired during Super Bowl LVII.\nMore info: https://co
 medyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/david-lucas-roast-therapy/
